title: "BDD_Dataset: A Behavior-Driven Dataset for Python Code Generation Benchmarks"
version: 1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22645322
date-released: 2026-09-10
url: "https://github.com/malikhunain/BDD_Dataset"
repository-code: "https://github.com/malikhunain/BDD-Dataset-Generation"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A Python/Behave Behavior-Driven Development (BDD) dataset for code
  generation benchmarks, translated from HumanEval and MBPP, fully
  execution-verified. Contains 1,137 problems, 6,183 scenarios, and
  21,122 steps, each paired with the original human-authored HumanEval/MBPP
  canonical reference solution. Every problem is execution-verified via
  behave.
keywords:
  - behavior-driven development
  - Gherkin
  - code generation
